  },
  {
    "who": "yametaro",
    "text": "白い仮面に、その筋肉。初対面やと、ちょっと身構えるな。",
    "mood": "surprise",
    "scene": "profile",
    "audio": "line04_yametaro.wav",
    "seed": 7,
    "durationScale": "0.85",
    "model": "Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small",
    "caption": "",
    "textCfg": 5,
    "uncut": true,
    "reference": "02_CHARACTERS/Yametaro_voice.wav",
    "reading": "しろいかめんに、そのきんにく。しょたいめんやと、ちょっとみがまえるな。"
  },
  {
    "who": "takosan",
    "text": "でも、見た目は怖くても優しい人。ビールがあると、ご機嫌です。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "scene": "kind",
    "audio": "line05_takosan.wav",
    "seed": 43,
    "durationScale": "1",
    "model": "Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small",
