    "uncut": true,
    "reference": "02_CHARACTERS/Takosan_voice.wav"
  },
  {
    "who": "yametaro",
    "text": "話しかけるきっかけが、乾杯で済むのは助かるわ。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "scene": "kind",
    "audio": "line06_yametaro.wav",
    "seed": 7,
    "durationScale": "0.70",
    "model": "Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small",
    "caption": "",
    "textCfg": 5,
    "uncut": true,
    "reference": "02_CHARACTERS/Yametaro_voice.wav"
  },
  {
    "who": "takosan",
    "text": "入社したときの椅子は、段ボール製のアーロンチュアでした。",
    "mood": "bored",
    "scene": "chair",
    "audio": "line07_takosan.wav",
    "seed": 43,
    "durationScale": "1",
    "model": "Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small",
    "caption": "",
    "textCfg": 5,
    "uncut": true,
    "reference": "02_CHARACTERS/Takosan_voice.wav"
  },
  {
    "who": "yametaro",
    "text": "名前だけ聞いたら、高級な椅子やと思うやろ。",
    "mood": "bored",
    "scene": "chair",
    "audio": "line08_yametaro.wav",
    "seed": 7,
    "durationScale": "0.70",
    "model": "Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small",
    "caption": "",
    "textCfg": 5,
    "uncut": true,
    "reference": "02_CHARACTERS/Yametaro_voice.wav"
  },
  {
    "who": "takosan",
    "text": "その後、席は窓際から、ビルの外のベランダへ移されます。",
    "mood": "worry",
    "scene": "balcony",
    "audio": "line09_takosan.wav",
    "seed": 43,
    "durationScale": "1",
    "model": "Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small",
    "caption": "",
    "textCfg": 5,
    "uncut": true,
    "reference": "02_CHARACTERS/Takosan_voice.wav",
    "reading": "そのご、せきは、まどぎわから、ビルのそとのベランダへ、うつされます。"
  },
  {
    "who": "yametaro",
    "text": "窓際って、窓の内側ちゃうんか。冬は寒いやろ。",
    "mood": "worry",
    "scene": "balcony",
    "audio": "line10_yametaro.wav",
    "seed": 7,
    "durationScale": "0.70",
    "model": "Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small",
    "caption": "",
    "textCfg": 5,
    "uncut": true,
    "reference": "02_CHARACTERS/Yametaro_voice.wav"
  },
  {
    "who": "takosan",
    "text": "本人は、ビールが冷えたままなのでメリット、と受け止めます。",
    "mood": "smug",
    "scene": "positive",
    "audio": "line11_takosan.wav",
    "seed": 43,
    "durationScale": "1",
    "model": "Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small",
    "caption": "",
    "textCfg": 5,
    "uncut": true,
    "reference": "02_CHARACTERS/Takosan_voice.wav"
  },
  {
    "who": "yametaro",
    "text": "社員の席を、冷蔵庫みたいに扱ったらあかんやろ。",
    "mood": "angry",
    "scene": "positive",
    "audio": "line12_yametaro.wav",
    "seed": 7,
    "durationScale": "0.70",
    "model": "Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small",
